&amp; Figures" class="h-12 mb-4 link_link__db9uP" style="color:#021A65" href="/facts-and-figures"><span>Facts &amp; Figures</span></a></div><div class="styles_desktop-menu__first-level__ndilw relative w-max z-30 block text-4xl font-light cursor-pointer first-level pr-12"><a data-title="Media Library" class="h-12 mb-4 link_link__db9uP" style="color:#021A65" href="/media"><span>Media Library</span></a></div><div class="styles_desktop-menu__first-level__ndilw relative w-max z-30 block text-4xl font-light cursor-pointer first-level pr-12"><a data-title="Contact Public Relations" class="h-12 mb-4 link_link__db9uP" target="_self" style="color:#021A65" href="/Contact"><span>Contact Public Relations</span></a></div></div></div></div><li class="styles_desktop-menu__item__RzKqE my-7 cursor-pointer font-normal group transition lg:mx-8 xl:mx-10 xl:last:mr-0">News &amp; Reports<span class="block h-px transition-all duration-500 max-w-0 group-hover:max-w-full bg-(--textColor)"></span></li></ul></div></div></nav></div><a class="fixed bottom-xxs right-xxs text-ar-body text-white z-999 group" href="/annual-results"><div class="bg-ar-seafoam flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold tracking-wider"><div class="inline-flex items-center my-2.5 mx-4 relative"><span>Annual Results 2025</span><figure class="w-3.25 ml-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 13.114 13.114"><path fill="none" stroke="#fff" d="m5.18553 1.486255 7.071067 5.07137-7.071068 5.07137"></path></svg></figure><div class="h-px bg-white absolute mt-1 bottom-0 left-0 right-full transition-all duration-300 group-hover:right-4.25"></div></div></div></a><main class="bg-white relative z-10"><div class="px-xxs md:px-sm bg-white"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg"><div class="col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-11 mt-xxl mb-xxs md:mb-sm"><div class="styles_richtext__vtvls"><h1><span style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25)"><span class="text-h1 font-thin">Investing to benefit people and the planet</span></span></h1></div></div><div class="col-span-full md:col-span-8 font-novoApply"><div class="styles_richtext__vtvls"><p><span style="color: #191919">The holding and investment company of the Novo Nordisk Foundation</span></p></div></div><div class="relative flex mb-12 -mx-5 overflow-hidden md:mx-0 col-span-full aspect-high md:aspect-video"><div class="relative aspect-video cursor-pointer w-full mt-xs aspect-high md:aspect-video md:mt-md"><video class="absolute inset-0 object-cover w-full h-full" autoPlay="" muted="" loop="" playsInline=""><source src="https://assets.novoholdings.dk/nh_frontpage_film.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video></div></div></div></div><section style="background:#FFFFFF" id=""><div class="px-xxs md:px-sm"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 col-start-1 col-span-full 2xl:col-start-3 2xl:col-span-8 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg 2xl:grid-cols-8 py-lg"><div class="col-span-3 md:col-start-2 md:col-end-5 lg:col-start-3 lg:col-end-6 xl:col-start-1 xl:col-end-4" style="color:#191919"><div class="styles_richtext__vtvls"><h3><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">About us</span><br><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)"><strong>Holdings and investments</strong></span></h3></div></div><div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 col-start-2 col-end-5 md:col-start-6 md:col-end-12 lg:col-start-7 lg:col-end-11 xl:col-start-5 xl:col-end-9 3xl:col-end-8" style="color:#191919"><div class="styles_richtext__vtvls"><p>Novo Holdings is a holding and investment company that is responsible for managing the assets and the wealth of the Novo Nordisk Foundation, one of the world’s largest enterprise foundations.</p><p>Novo Holdings is the controlling shareholder of Novo Nordisk and Novonesis (the Novo Group companies) and manages an investment portfolio with a long-term return perspective. Novo Holdings invests in life science companies at all stages of development and, in addition, manages a broad portfolio of equities, bonds, real estate and infrastructure assets as well as private equity investments.</p><p><span style="color: ">As of year-end 2025, Novo Holdings had Total Assets under Management of DKK 694 billion (EUR 93 billion).</span></p></div><a data-title="See our Annual Results" class="mt-6 text-xs font-bold font-novoApply min-w-max link_link__db9uP" href="https://novoholdings.dk/annual-results" target="_blank" style="color:#D3B276"><span>See our Annual Results</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white"><div class="px-xxs md:px-sm"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 col-start-1 col-span-full 2xl:col-start-3 2xl:col-span-8 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg 2xl:grid-cols-8 py-lg"><p class="text-dark font-novoApply text-body col-span-full md:col-span-5">Our investment areas</p><div class="mt-4 text-dark col-span-full md:col-span-9"><div class="styles_richtext__vtvls"><h2><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Novo Holdings is a holding and investment company that is responsible for managing the assets and the wealth of the Novo Nordisk Foundation. The purpose of Novo Holdings is to improve people’s health and the sustainability of society and the planet by generating attractive long-term returns on the assets of the Novo Nordisk Foundation.</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="overflow-hidden py-lg"><div class="flex w-full"><a class="two-video_video__UwNZy" href="/investments"><div class="relative aspect-video cursor-pointer two-video_video__player__BJ7Vi"><video class="absolute inset-0 object-cover w-full h-full" autoPlay="" muted="" loop="" playsInline=""><source src="https://assets.novoholdings.dk/gettyimages-1282850171.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video></div><div class="absolute text-center top-1/2 right-1/2 translate-x-2/4 w-full"><p class="text-dark font-novoApply text-body text-sm" style="color:#191919">Explore</p><p class="text-[2.5rem]" style="color:#191919">Investments</p></div></a><a class="two-video_video__UwNZy" href="/novo-group"><div class="relative aspect-video cursor-pointer two-video_video__player__BJ7Vi"><video class="absolute inset-0 object-cover w-full h-full" autoPlay="" muted="" loop="" playsInline=""><source src="https://assets.novoholdings.dk/nh-novo-group-intro.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></video></div><div class="absolute text-center top-1/2 right-1/2 translate-x-2/4 w-full"><p class="text-dark font-novoApply text-body text-sm" style="color:#fff">Explore</p><p class="text-[2.5rem]" style="color:#fff">Novo Group</p></div></a></div></section><section class="quote__section w-full relative bg-white"><div class="px-xxs md:px-sm py-lg quote__section__grid grid-flow-dense lg:h-full"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg"><figure class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-portrait col-span-full w-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-6"><img alt="Kasim Kutay" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute w-full object-cover quote__image object-center" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:31.381974248927037% 43.81935483870968%;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F5825x3875%2F928ec15aee%2F_k7a2895.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></figure><div class="flex flex-col justify-center col-span-full mt-12 md:mt-0 text-dark  md:col-start-7 md:col-end-12"><blockquote class="mb-11"><div class="styles_richtext__vtvls styles_quote__block__aHUoR"><h2><span class="font-thin">“We are committed to better healthcare and a greener future. We invest to promote groundbreaking solutions in healthcare and bio-sustainability.&quot;</span></h2></div></blockquote><p class="text-dark font-novoApply text-body">Kasim Kutay</p><p class="text-dark font-novoApply text-body">CEO, Novo Holdings</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-lg bg-white"><div class="px-xxs md:px-sm grid-flow-dense"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg"><div class="styles_richtext__vtvls lg:col-span-3 col-span-full flex flex-col justify-center mt-6 mb-6 lg:mb-0 text-dark"><h3><strong><span style="color: ">Novo Holdings posts record Total Income and Investment Returns of DKK 20 billion (EUR 2.7 billion) in 2025.</span></strong></h3><p><span style="color: ">&quot;Novo Holdings delivered a strong 9.2% CER return in 2025 despite significant market volatility. With increased asset and geographic diversification across our investment portfolio, we believe we are well positioned to continue generating attractive long-term returns in support of the Novo Nordisk Foundation’s purpose of improving people’s health and the sustainability of society and the planet.” - </span>Kasim Kutay, CEO, Novo Holdings</p></div><div class="relative aspect-video cursor-pointer -mx-5 md:mx-0 col-span-full lg:col-start-5 lg:col-end-13 lg:ml-8 styles_video-with-text__video__9nebz"><div class="relative w-full h-full"><button type="button" class="styles_media__button__oRXoq inline-block absolute z-10 inset-1/2"></button><video class="absolute inset-0 object-cover w-full h-full" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/228216/x/50aa3f8863/annual_results_2025_v1-1080p.mp4" poster="https://a.storyblok.com/f/228216/1403x763/b7c686fba3/thumbnail-ar-2025-website.jpg"></video></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-lg w-full h-full relative overflow-hidden"><div class="px-xxs md:px-sm big-image-text_big-image-grid__Z9JuU md:w-full h-full"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg"><div class="big-image-text_big-text-c-module__image-container__wpbs7 relative overflow-hidden col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-7 w-full md:h-[90%] mb-2"><figure class="big-image-text_big-text-c-module__image__qRvMM relative w-full h-full flex overflow-hidden" id="parallax-image"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="w-full absolute object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.novoholdings.dk%2Fnnf_nh-bygning.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></figure></div><div class="flex flex-col self-center justify-center w-full h-full pt-4 col-span-full md:col-start-8 md:col-end-12 md:pt-0"><div class="styles_richtext__vtvls"><h3>Who we are</h3><p>We operate from offices in Copenhagen, London, San Francisco, Boston, Singapore, Shanghai and Mumbai.<br><br>We recruit candidates from diverse backgrounds who embrace a culture of high performance with respect and responsibility. Read more about our <strong><span style="color: #D3B276"><a uuid="null" target="_self" href="https://assets.novoholdings.dk/diversity-policy-for-novo-holdings.pdf">diversity policy</a></span></strong>.</p></div><a data-title="Meet us" class="mt-10 text-xs font-bold font-novoApply link_link__db9uP" target="_self" rel="" style="color:#43485C" href="/people"><span>Meet us</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-sm md:py-lg bg-white" id="regions"><div class="px-xxs md:px-sm"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-sm md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-lg"><div class="relative col-span-5"><h4 class="text-dark mb-11">Investment Regions</h4><div><button type="button" class="regions-navigation_investment-regions__link__pydX_ region"><div class="regions-navigation_investment-regions__image--mobile__tP_4l relative col-span-4 md:hidden"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F626x455%2F23a01d0515%2Fnorth-america_nh-picture.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F626x455%2F23a01d0515%2Fnorth-america_nh-picture.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F626x455%2F23a01d0515%2Fnorth-america_nh-picture.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F228216%2F626x455%2F23a01d0515