Investment Portfolio in 2025\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"\"}}]}]}]},\"component\":\"n8-stats-grid-list-item\",\"currency_items\":[{\"_uid\":\"43758493-0fb8-4837-9f62-53646452c13a\",\"amount\":\"2.3%\",\"suffix\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":null}}]},\"currency\":\"\",\"component\":\"n8-stats-grid-list-currency-item\"},{\"_uid\":\"bfc2a9f6-b63d-4384-9da7-a8512462a9f8\",\"amount\":\"2.3%\",\"suffix\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":null}}]},\"currency\":\"\",\"component\":\"n8-stats-grid-list-currency-item\"},{\"_uid\":\"959fa450-5c4c-40cb-9a76-de911a4c2f06\",\"amount\":\"2.3%\",\"suffix\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":null}}]},\"currency\":\"\",\"component\":\"n8-stats-grid-list-currency-item\"}]}],\"title\":\"Annual Review \",\"component\":\"n8-stats-grid\",\"footnotes\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},\"is_narrow\":false,\"section_name\":\"\",\"background_color\":{\"value\":\"#ffffff\",\"plugin\":\"storyblok-palette\"}}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"27:[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"story\":{\"name\":\"Home\",\"created_at\":\"2023-08-09T15:44:05.041Z\",\"published_at\":\"2026-03-18T09:40:42.792Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-18T09:40:42.813Z\",\"id\":352786608,\"uuid\":\"4d46ee81-6a64-4755-b334-7d79096f0655\",\"content\":{\"_uid\":\"15747634-a464-48e3-9bea-1b102ca4bc3d\",\"body\":[{\"Body\":\"The holding and investment company of the Novo Nordisk Foundation\",\"_uid\":\"875c3f1d-aed7-4843-bea2-c0179443a8b9\",\"Media\":\"$17:props:children:0:0:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:props:media\",\"Title\":\"Investing to benefit people and the planet\",\"Content\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"The holding and investment company of the Novo Nordisk Foundation\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"#191919\"}}]}]}]},\"Heading\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":1},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Investing to benefit people and the planet\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"styled\",\"attrs\":{\"class\":\"text-h1 font-thin\"}},{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"rgb(25, 25, 25)\"}}]}]}]},\"component\":\"hero\"},{\"_uid\":\"23f568b9-7fda-4b99-a42a-aef9105e3db3\",\"body\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":null},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Novo Holdings is a holding and investment company that is responsible for managing the assets and the wealth of the Novo Nordisk Foundation, one of the world’s largest enterprise foundations.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":null},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Novo Holdings is the controlling shareholder of Novo Nordisk and Novonesis (the Novo Group companies) and manages an investment portfolio with a long-term return perspective. Novo Holdings invests in life science companies at all stages of development and, in addition, manages a broad portfolio of equities, bonds, real estate and infrastructure assets as well as private equity investments.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":null},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"As of year-end 2025, Novo Holdings had Total Assets under Management of DKK 694 billion (EUR 93 billion).\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"\"}}]}]}]},\"link\":{\"id\":\"48d1c423-a43c-469f-a954-b0b69f79f4d5\",\"rel\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"color\":\"#43485C\",\"title\":\"Read more about us\",\"target\":\"_self\",\"linktype\":\"story\",\"fieldtype\":\"multilink\",\"cached_url\":\"about\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":3},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"About us\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"rgb(51, 51, 51)\"}}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Holdings and investments\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"},{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"rgb(51, 51, 51)\"}}]}]}]},\"bg_color\":{\"value\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"plugin\":\"storyblok-palette\"},\"anchor_id\":\"\",\"component\":\"text_module\",\"text_color\":{\"value\":\"#191919\",\"plugin\":\"storyblok-palette\"},\"multiple_link\":[{\"_uid\":\"e875b335-8705-4ef5-ad5c-8ab6acd03d02\",\"link\":{\"id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://novoholdings.dk/annual-results\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"linktype\":\"url\",\"fieldtype\":\"multilink\",\"cached_url\":\"https://novoholdings.dk/annual-results\"},\"color\":{\"value\":\"#D3B276\",\"plugin\":\"storyblok-palette\"},\"label\":\"See our Annual Results\",\"component\":\"link_item\"}]},{\"_uid\":\"6e713f3c-d176-4c2b-ae43-5492f179f6cf\",\"body\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Novo Holdings is a holding and investment company that is responsible for managing the assets and the wealth of the Novo Nordisk Foundation. The purpose of Novo Holdings is to improve people’s health and the sustainability of society and the planet by generating attractive long-term returns on the assets of the Novo Nordisk Foundation.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"rgb(0, 0, 0)\"}}]}]}]},\"heading\":\"Our investment areas\",\"component\":\"text_module_b\"},\"$1c:props:blok\",\"$1d:props:blok\",{\"_uid\":\"57a4968e-441d-48ff-8aaa-7cf39c7e49dc\",\"Media\":\"$1e:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:media\",\"poster\":\"$1e:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:poster\",\"content\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":3,\"textAlign\":null},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Novo Holdings posts record Total Income and Investment Returns of DKK 20 billion (EUR 2.7 billion) in 2025.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":null},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"\\\"Novo Holdings delivered a strong 9.2% CER return in 2025 despite significant market volatility. With increased asset and geographic diversification across our investment portfolio, we believe we are well positioned to continue generating attractive long-term returns in support of the Novo Nordisk Foundation’s purpose of improving people’s health and the sustainability of society and the planet.” - \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"\"}}]},{\"text\":\"Kasim Kutay, CEO, Novo Holdings\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"component\":\"video_with_text\",\"isVideoLeft\":false},{\"_uid\":\"7b52ba2f-8ca0-4d09-8599-2e4f8ddd18ae\",\"body\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":3,\"textAlign\":null},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Who we are\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":null},\"content\":[{\"text\":\"We operate from offices in Copenhagen, London, San Francisco, Boston, Singapore, Shanghai and Mumbai.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"We recruit candidates from diverse backgrounds who embrace a culture of high performance with respect and responsibility. Read more about our \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"diversity policy\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://assets.novoholdings.dk/diversity-policy-for-novo-holdings.pdf\",\"uuid\":null,\"anchor\":null,\"target\":\"_self\",\"linktype\":\"url\"}},{\"type\":\"textStyle\",\"attrs\":{\"color\":\"#D3B276\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\".\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"link\":{\"id\":\"e63da639-4019-4df5-a810-75dcf0ddaa35\",\"rel\":\"\",\"url\":\"\",\"color\":\"#43485C\",\"title\":\"Meet us\",\"target\":\"_self\",\"linktype\":\"story\",\"fieldtype\":\"multilink\"